.DS_Store

# The viewer is a BUILT-ON-DEMAND bundle (c13; PLAN-V3 decision 12). Its build-time dependencies
# and its output never enter the repository: the root package.json's zero-runtime-dependency
# property is a stated repo property, viewer/package-lock.json IS committed so the build stays
# reproducible, and `legion viewer` refuses loudly (naming the two commands that fix it) when the
# bundle is absent rather than serving a blank page. Landed with the server, BEFORE the first
# build exists, so neither directory can ever be staged by accident.
viewer/dist/
viewer/node_modules/
